      "message": "I think atomic_set_bit(\u0026tbt_usb4_3a_reset, port) should only be set after confirming the Hard Reset succeeded. In the current code, if pdc_power_mgmt_connector_reset() fails or the partner doesn\u0027t respond, the flag is still set, incorrectly blocking any subsequent reset attempts on that port.",
